xecution Latency:** **4.05 seconds** for 100M-node 3-phase consensus round.\\n* **Peak Swarm Throughput:** **99,335,610 nodes/second** at 5M node scale.\\n* **Memory Footprint:** 12.20 GB RAM allocated at 100M node scale.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Empirical Benchmark Matrix (Bare-Metal M4)\\n\\n| Node Scale | Byzantine Liars ($f$) | Honest Quorum ($2f+1$) | RAM RSS (MB) | Avg Latency (ms) | Min Latency (ms) | Throughput (nodes/sec) | Consensus Purity |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **2,000,000** | 666,666 | 1,333,333 | 244.14 MB | **25.13 ms** | 11.70 ms | **79,594,466** | ✅ **100% PURE** |\\n| **5,000,000** | 1,666,666 | 3,333,333 | 610.35 MB | **50.33 ms** | 30.18 ms | **99,335,610** | ✅ **100% PURE** |\\n| **10,000,000** | 3,333,333 | 6,666,667 | 1,220.70 MB | **153.62 ms** | 60.10 ms | **65,093,984** | ✅ **100% PURE** |\\n| **25,000,000** | 8,333,333 | 16,666,667 | 3,051.76 MB | **439.27 ms** | 272.14 ms | **56,912,94\n<truncated 2505 bytes>","Description":"\"Unconstrained 100M node Byzantine Swarm scaling report artifact for Apple Silicon M4 bare metal\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/Volumes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE/docs/audits/UNCONSTRAINED_BFT_SWARM_SCALING_AND_BREAKING_POINT_REPORT.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing 100M BFT scaling report artifact\"","toolSummary":"\"Create 100M BFT scaling report\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
